  "notes": "{固|かた}める is an ichidan verb meaning to harden, solidify, or strengthen.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{固|かた}まる→固まる：01928_katamaru⟧ (intransitive, to harden)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{決意|けつい}→決意：07167_ketsui⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{固|かた}める: to firm up one's resolve\n- ⟦{守|まも}り→守り：12250_mamori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{固|かた}める: to strengthen defense\n- ⟦{足元|あしもと}→足元：04096_ashimoto⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{固|かた}める: to secure one's footing\n- ⟦{土|つち}→土：02229_tsuchi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{固|かた}める: to pack the soil\n- ⟦{身|み}→身：01764_mi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{固|かた}める: to settle down (get married)\n\nRELATED ADJECTIVE:\n⟦{固|かた}い→固い：12090_katai⟧: hard, solid, firm",
